# Copy this file to `.secrets/supabase_secret` (no .example suffix).
# Put the key on a single line, with no quotes.
#
# This file holds only the Supabase **personal access token** (`sbp_...`).
# Create it at: Dashboard → Account → Access Tokens
#
# Use it for Management API / CLI (deploy storage SQL policies).
# It is NOT the app key. The iOS app uses anon/publishable in
# `CircleLink/SupabaseSecrets.plist` (also gitignored).
#
# NEVER put this token in:
#   - CircleLink/SupabaseSecrets.plist
#   - Info.plist, pbxproj, Swift source, or any committed markdown
#
# Git: `.secrets/supabase_secret` is gitignored. Commit only this .example file.

YOUR_SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN
